Z||000024||tgowens||08-12-2000||06:39 PM||||i'll try..........go to the "profile" link on the first page of the forum (the one which shows "Technical", General Fiero Chat", "Mall" and "O/T" - click on it and then find the "signature" section of your profile......in that box put in <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/hugh_sig.gif" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/hugh_sig.gif</A>  and place the [IMG] right before the http: and place [/IMG right after .gif -- that's how you set up your signature - then when you type a message or reply you will see a check box right below the text screen you are typing in labeled "show Signature" - check it then hit the "submit Reply" button - that's all there is to it -- I prefer to put my signature on my own server (snip.net in your case) rather than to tie up Cliff's server -- but.........try it this way first and then we can go from there...........||||reg||1
